__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.swp
*.tmp

# The looping battle theme and whatever it was imported from are supplied
# locally, not by this repository: bin/make-battle-audio generates the two
# fanfares and nothing else. The daemon treats a missing theme as silence, so
# a fresh checkout still plays and still fights; it just does it quietly until
# someone drops a file they have the right to use at assets/battle-theme.wav.
assets/battle-theme.wav
assets/*.source.*
